<title>UK: Bowthorpe H1 pretax profit rises.</title>
<headline>Bowthorpe H1 pretax profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		12.38		  vs 11.31</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 3.21		   vs 3.0</p>
<p> Pretax		     42.47		  vs 39.64</p>
<p> Turnover		   270.54		 vs 234.24</p>
<p>NOTE - Electronics and electrical group Bowthorpe Plc said pre-tax profit for the second half was likely to show a comparable rate of growth to the interim results.  </p>
<p> Operating result	 42.6		   vs 38.9</p>
<p> Interest		   0.18 payable	 vs 0.66 receivable</p>
<p> Tax			  14.5		   vs 14.9</p>
<p> Net taxed		  27.9		   vs 24.7</p>
<p> Pay date		   December 9</p>
<p> Div registration date  October 8</p>
<p> Ex-div date		September 30</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 5427717</p>
